      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "R-right! You'll take it on?\r\nThen I'll explain in a bit more detail.",
        "Jp" : "よ、よし！　受けてくれるんだな？\r\nじゃあもうちょっと詳しく説明するぞ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 286353,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 1,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Betland Cemetery—'twas originally a graveyard for\r\nthe northern folk, but years past, orcs and\r\nArisen waged a siege there.",
        "Jp" : "《バートランド墓地》っていうところはな\r\nもともと北部の民の墓だったんだが、\r\n数年前の戦いで、オークと覚者が\r\n籠城戦をした場所でもある"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 286354,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 2,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "And then, several of their number sealed the\r\ncemetery from within—themselves along with\r\nit, to cage the orcs.",
        "Jp" : "で、その時に彼らの数人は\r\n内部から墓地を封鎖したんだよ\r\n自分らともども、オークを閉じ込めるために"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 286355,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 3,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "'Twas sealed tight e'er since, but that can't\r\nstand forever—so we decided to release the seal.",
        "Jp" : "それ以降、封鎖しっぱなしだったわけだが\r\nさすがにそのままってのもな――\r\nで、封鎖を解除することにしたんだ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 397831,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 4,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "I called out to a few people for help, \r\nbut not a one would take it on.",
        "Jp" : "やぁ、何人か声を掛けたんだが\r\n引き受けてくれる奴がいなかったんだよな"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 286357,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 5,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Well, that's the lay of it. Investigation and\r\nextermination—I'm counting on you!",
        "Jp" : "――まぁそういうわけなんだ\r\nじゃ、調査と討伐、頼んだからな！"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 286358,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
