      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 8,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Hate to think about it, but for them,\r\nit's a given, isn't it?\r\nThat there was enough feed...",
        "Jp" : "考えたくないが、奴らにとっては\r\nあったってワケだよな\r\n十分な食糧が――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 286361,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 9,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Be that as it may, goodly work! At this rate,\r\nmayhap we can drive back the orc army and restore\r\nthe road to Northern Betland Plains.",
        "Jp" : "ともあれ、ご苦労さん！\r\nこの調子なら、オーク軍を後退させて\r\nバートランド平原北部への道を\r\n再整備できるかもしれん"
